                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Your adopted brother Jace was attacked by a being known as an Other as a young boy and you are trying to find a cure for his disease.  You have found the Others world and entered into it.  There is friction between humans and Others because they are feared for their powers.\nThis is quick paced HO game with very few HO scenes and many mini puzzles.  Game is a good length and I found it enjoyable.  There is an interactive map for fast travelling which shows active areas.  Bonus chapter folllowed on from main story. \nEach scene has a hidden raven in it and you can go back and track down the missing ones in the extras page.  All collected ravens will give you another HO scene.  The extras also shows your achievements and has other mini-games.\nAn entertaining game to wile away your time.  7.5/10",
